  "notable_quotes": [
    "C3H6 diffusion in NCU-20 is limited at 298 K (D/r2 = 2.32 × 10−5 s−1) but improves to 1.17 × 10−4 and 1.43 × 10−4 s−1 at 323 and 353 K.",
    "Breakthrough tests gave 65.39 cm3 cm−3 productivity of >99.5% pure C3H6 from an equimolar C3H6/C3H8 mixture.",
    "Diffusion barriers favor propylene sieving: ΔE is 21.8 kJ mol−1 for C3H6 but 99.1 kJ mol−1 for C3H8, indicating strong hindrance for propane."
